    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27783" root="عبث" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِبِّيثٌ</span></b>  One <i>who plays,</i> or <i>sports, much,</i> or <i>often.</i>
(K. [In the O written <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبِيثٌ</span>, but said in the K
to be like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِكِّينٌ</span>, perhaps a mistranscription for
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِكِّيتٌ</span>.])

